  "prefLabel": "En 608.04 Department Inspection",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 608.04 Department Inspection. The department shall, from time to time, inspect the works and system of each water utility and the manner in which it has conformed and presently conforms to statutes or department or commission rules or orders.\n\nSource. #13911, eff 3-21-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 600)",
